  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Attack smarter, not harder.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Int 13, Focused Shot, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use Focused Shot with any ranged weapon, not just bows or crossbows. You gain a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls when using Focused Shot. If using Spheres of Might, this counts as a special attack action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
